Provenance: the claim-accounting pattern (claim inventory -> evidence bindings
-> executed results -> claim ledger -> truthful disposition) and the portable
questions in QUESTIONS.md were extracted conceptually from the reference test
harness of the ANAXI persistent-agent research project. This package is an
independent, newly written implementation; it contains no source code, data,
tests or history from that project, and does not depend on it at runtime.
